works the same way in explore-mode, wizard-mode and normal-mode.

all the recent "scuz" has been about getting 7 wishes from a single
wand of wishing.  you have discovered that you can obviously get 6
wishes and that if you recharge the wand (any wand actually) again
it will disintegrate.  the solution is similar to the solution used
to dig into shop walls.  observant hackers will notice that on occasion
they can wrest another spell from a worn-out wand, if they're lucky ...

btw, perhaps the message when zapping a wand with zero charges should
be "Nothing seems to happen" to be consistent with other hidden effects.

